---
/**
 * Explicit SRS §6.2 deviation, informed product-owner decision — see
 * docs/status/KNOWN_RISKS.md. Only ever rendered by MarketingLayout.astro
 * when `PUBLIC_APP_ENV === "production"`; never on the authenticated
 * app/admin layouts, and never in local/preview.
 *
 * Kept as its own component (rather than inlined in MarketingLayout) because
 * Astro's compiler cannot parse a `<script is:inline>` body containing `{}`
 * when the tag itself sits inside a `{condition && (...)}` JSX expression —
 * this file's `<script>` tags stay at the template root, so the caller only
 * ever nests a plain `<GoogleAnalytics />` element inside that expression.
 */
---

<script async is:inline src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-1W5HP7S561"></script>
<script is:inline>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  function gtag() {
    dataLayer.push(arguments);
  }
  gtag("js", new Date());
  gtag("config", "G-1W5HP7S561");
</script>
